{
  "about": "The one fixture both readers of a `reads <package> <list> generated` line test against (Node's condition 2 on #q11k6k6): the planner's key reader (loom planner/reads.go, generatedReads) and the gate's run.py cover(). A copy of it sits beside each reader, byte for byte. tree is the tracked files; list is the line's list; reads are the tracked paths the list bounds; changes say, for each change to tree, whether it moves the package's key (the planner) and fires the line (run.py); badLists are lists each reader must read as the whole tree.",
